  "html": "<div class=\"fr-view\">\n<style>\n.akey-item{background:var(--card-bg,rgba(128,128,128,.06));border:1px solid var(--border,rgba(128,128,128,.18));\n  border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;}\n.akey-head{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-bottom:8px;}\n.akey-num{font-weight:700;color:var(--accent,#e63946);}\n.akey-prompt{margin:6px 0 10px;}\n.akey-prompt audio{display:block;margin:8px 0;max-width:420px;height:36px;}\n.akey-prompt img{max-width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:8px;display:block;margin:8px 0;}\n.akey-prompt ruby rt{font-size:.55em;}\n.akey-answer{border-left:3px solid #2f9e63;background:rgba(47,158,99,.10);\n  border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;padding:8px 12px;}\n.akey-answer .akey-label{font-size:.72rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.5px;color:#2f9e63;\n  text-transform:uppercase;display:block;margin-bottom:4px;}\n.akey-answer audio{display:block;margin:6px 0;max-width:380px;height:34px;}\n.akey-answer .akey-choice{margin:2px 0;font-weight:600;}\n</style>\n<h3>Week 8 Test — Answer Key</h3><p>Every question with its correct answer. Listening clips are playable inline.</p><a href=\"../weeks/week8-test.html\" class=\"test-link-card\"><span class=\"test-link-icon\">📝</span><div class=\"test-link-info\"><h3>Take this test interactively</h3><p>Scored, one question at a time, with instant feedback</p></div><span class=\"test-link-arrow\">→</span></a><div class=\"akey-item\"><div class=\"akey-head\"><span class=\"akey-num\">Q1</span></div><div class=\"akey-prompt\"><p>Please choose the correct answer to this question: <ruby>日本 <rp>(</rp> <rt>にほん</rt> <rp>)</rp> </ruby>へ <ruby>何 <rp>(</rp> <rt>なに</rt> <rp>)</rp> </ruby>の <ruby>勉強 <rp>(</rp> <rt>べんきょう</rt> </ruby>に <ruby>来 <rp>(</rp> <rt>き</rt> <rp>)</rp> </ruby>ましたか。</p></div><div class=\"akey-answer\"><span class=\"akey-label\">Correct answer</span><div class=\"akey-choice\">Clip 3</div><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" src=\"../audio/tests/week_08/w4-8test_q1-c3.m4a\">If you are reading this, it is because your browser does not support the audio element.</audio></div></div><div class=\"akey-item\"><div class=\"akey-head\"><span class=\"akey-num\">Q2</span></div><div class=\"akey-prompt\"><div class=\"fr-view\"><p><br/></p></div><p>Please choose the correct answer to this question: <ruby>手伝 <rp>(</rp> <rt>て　つだ</rt> <rp>)</rp></ruby>いましょうか</p></div><div class=\"akey-answer\"><span class=\"akey-label\">Correct answer</span><div class=\"akey-choice\">Clip 1</div><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" src=\"../audio/tests/week_08/w4-8test_q2-c1.m4a\">If you are reading this, it is because your browser does not support the audio element.</audio></div></div><div class=\"akey-item\"><div class=\"akey-head\"><span class=\"akey-num\">Q3</span></div><div class=\"akey-prompt\"><p>Please choose the correct answer: ペットボトルとこのファイルを <ruby>席<rp>(</rp><rt>せき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に <ruby>置<rp>(</rp><rt>お</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いてください。</p></div><div class=\"akey-answer\"><span class=\"akey-label\">Correct answer</span><div class=\"akey-choice\">Clip 1</div><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" src=\"../audio/tests/week_08/w4-8test_q3-c1.m4a\">If you are reading this, it is because your browser does not support the audio element.</audio></div></div><div class=\"akey-item\"><div class=\"akey-head\"><span class=\"akey-num\">Q4</span></div><div class=\"akey-prompt\"><div class=\"fr-view\"><p>Please choose the correct answer to this question: ディズニーランドへ <ruby>行<rp>(</rp><rt>い</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ったことがありますか。</p></div></div><div class=\"akey-answer\"><span class=\"akey-label\">Correct answer</span><div class=\"akey-choice\">Clip 2</div><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" src=\"../audio/tests/week_08/w4-8test_q4-c2.m4a\">If you are reading this, it is because your browser does not support the audio element.</audio></div></div><div class=\"akey-item\"><div class=\"akey-head\"><span class=\"akey-num\">Q5</span></div><div class=\"akey-prompt\"><div class=\"fr-view\"><p><br/></p></div><p>Please choose the correct answer: <ruby>美術館<rp>(</rp><rt>びじゅつかん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の <ruby>中<rp>(</rp><rt>なか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>では 大きい <ruby>声<rp>(</rp><rt>こえ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で <ruby>話<rp>(</rp><rt>はな</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>さないでください。</p></div><div class=\"akey-answer\"><span class=\"akey-label\">Correct answer</span><div class=\"akey-choice\">Clip 3</div><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" src=\"../audio/tests/week_08/w4-8test_q5-c3.m4a\">If you are reading this, it is because your browser does not support the audio element.</audio></div></div><div class=\"akey-item\"><div class=\"akey-head\"><span class=\"akey-num\">Q6</span></div><div class=\"akey-prompt\"><div class=\"fr-view\"><p><span style='color: rgb(91, 91, 91); font-family: \"Open Sans\"; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;'><span class=\"fr-audio\" style=\"display: block; text-align: center;\"><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" src=\"../audio/tests/week_08/w4-8test_q6.m4a\">If you are reading this, it is because your browser does not support the audio element.</audio></span>Please listen and choose the correct answer to this question:</span></p><p><br/></p></div></div><div class=\"akey-answer\"><span class=\"akey-label\">Correct answer</span><div class=\"akey-choice\">Clip 2</div><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" src=\"../audio/tests/week_08/w4-8test_q6-c2.m4a\">If you are reading this, it is because your browser does not support the audio element.</audio></div></div><div class=\"akey-item\"><div class=\"akey-head\"><span class=\"akey-num\">Q7</span></div><div class=\"akey-prompt\"><div class=\"fr-view\"><p><span class=\"fr-audio\" style=\"display: block; text-align: center;\"><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" src=\"../audio/tests/week_08/w4-8test_q7.m4a\">If you are reading this, it is because your browser does not support the audio element.</audio></span>Please listen and choose the correct answer to this question:</p></div><p><br/></p></div><div class=\"akey-answer\"><span class=\"akey-label\">Correct answer</span><div class=\"akey-choice\">Clip 2</div><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" src=\"../audio/tests/week_08/w4-8test_q7-c2.m4a\">If you are reading this, it is because your browser does not support the audio element.</audio></div></div><div class=\"akey-item\"><div class=\"akey-head\"><span class=\"akey-num\">Q8</span></div><div class=\"akey-prompt\"><p><span class=\"fr-audio\" style=\"display: block; text-align: center;\"><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" src=\"../audio/tests/week_08/w4-8test_q8.m4a\">If you are reading this, it is because your browser does not support the audio element.</audio></span>Please listen and choose the correct answer:</p><p><br/></p></div><div class=\"akey-answer\"><span class=\"akey-label\">Correct answer</span><div class=\"akey-choice\">Clip 1</div><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" src=\"../audio/tests/week_08/w4-8test_q8-c1.m4a\">If you are reading this, it is because your browser does not support the audio element.</audio></div></div><div class=\"akey-item\"><div class=\"akey-head\"><span class=\"akey-num\">Q9</span></div><div class=\"akey-prompt\"><div class=\"fr-view\"><p>Please choose the correct answer to this question: アンナさんは　どんな<ruby>人<rt>ひと</rt></ruby>ですか。</p><p><br/></p></div></div><div class=\"akey-answer\"><span class=\"akey-label\">Correct answer</span><div class=\"akey-choice\">Ａ： 頭 がよくて、 まじめな 人 です。</div></div></div><div class=\"akey-item\"><div class=\"akey-head\"><span class=\"akey-num\">Q10</span></div><div class=\"akey-prompt\">Please choose the correct answer to this question: ラーメンは　おいしかったですか。</div><div class=\"akey-answer\"><span class=\"akey-label\">Correct answer</span><div class=\"akey-choice\">Ａ：いいえ、 おいしくなかったです。</div></div></div><div class=\"akey-item\"><div class=\"akey-head\"><span class=\"akey-num\">Q11</span></div><div class=\"akey-prompt\"><div class=\"fr-view\"><p><r>Please choose the correct answer to this question: <ruby>店<rt>みせ</rt></ruby>の<ruby>人<rt>ひと</rt></ruby>は　<ruby>親切<rt>しんせつ</rt></ruby>でしたか。</r></p></div></div><div class=\"akey-answer\"><span class=\"akey-label\">Correct answer</span><div class=\"akey-choice\">Ａ：いいえ、 親切 じゃありませんでした。</div></div></div><div class=\"akey-item\"><div class=\"akey-head\"><span class=\"akey-num\">Q12</span></div><div class=\"akey-prompt\"><div class=\"fr-view\"><p>Please choose the correct answer to this question: <ruby>趣味<rp>(</rp><rt>しゅみ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は　<ruby>何<rp>(</rp><rt>なん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ですか。</p></div></div><div class=\"akey-answer\"><span class=\"akey-label\">Correct answer</span><div class=\"akey-choice\">Ａ：マンガを 読 むことです。</div></div></div><div class=\"akey-item\"><div class=\"akey-head\"><span class=\"akey-num\">Q13</span></div><div class=\"akey-prompt\"><div class=\"fr-view\"><p>Please choose the correct answer to this question: <ruby>夏休 <rp>(</rp> <rt>なつやす</rt> <rp>)</rp> </ruby>みに <ruby>何 <rp>(</rp> <rt>なに</rt> <rp>)</rp> </ruby>を　したいですか。</p></div></div><div class=\"akey-answer\"><span class=\"akey-label\">Correct answer</span><div class=\"akey-choice\">Ａ： 海 で 泳 いだり、 山 に 登 ったり したいです。</div></div></div><div class=\"akey-item\"><div class=\"akey-head\"><span class=\"akey-num\">Q14</span></div><div class=\"akey-prompt\"><div class=\"fr-view\"><p>Please choose the correct answer to this question： <ruby><r><ruby>電話<rt>でんわ</rt></ruby> </r><rp>(</rp> <rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby><r><ruby>番号<rt>ばんごう</rt></ruby> </r><rp>(</rp>  <rp>)</rp></ruby>も <ruby><r><ruby>書</ruby> </r><rp>(</rp> <rt>か</rt> <rp>)</rp> </ruby>かなければなりませんか。</p></div></div><div class=\"akey-answer\"><span class=\"akey-label\">Correct answer</span><div class=\"akey-choice\">Ａ：いいえ、 書か なくても いいです。</div></div></div><div class=\"akey-item\"><div class=\"akey-head\"><span class=\"akey-num\">Q15</span></div><div class=\"akey-prompt\"><div class=\"fr-view\"><p>Please choose the correct answer to this question: <ruby>雨<rt>あめ</rt></ruby>でも　<ruby>登山<rt>とざん</rt></ruby>に　<ruby>行<rt>い</rt></ruby>きますか。</p></div></div><div class=\"akey-answer\"><span class=\"akey-label\">Correct answer</span><div class=\"akey-choice\">Ａ：いいえ、 雨 だったら、 行 きません。</div></div></div><div class=\"akey-item\"><div class=\"akey-head\"><span class=\"akey-num\">Q16</span></div><div class=\"akey-prompt\"><div class=\"fr-view\"><p>Please choose the correct answer to this question: <ruby>会議<rt>かいぎ</rt></ruby><ruby><rt></rt></ruby>を　<ruby>始<rt>はじ</rt></ruby>めますよ。</p></div></div><div class=\"akey-answer\"><span class=\"akey-label\">Correct answer</span><div class=\"akey-choice\">Ａ：すみません。 すぐ 行 きます。</div></div></div><div class=\"akey-item\"><div class=\"akey-head\"><span class=\"akey-num\">Q17</span></div><div class=\"akey-prompt\"><div class=\"fr-view\"><p>Please choose the correct answer to this question: <ruby>荷物<rt>にもつ</rt></ruby>は　いつ　<ruby>届<rt>とど</rt></ruby>きますか。</p></div></div><div class=\"akey-answer\"><span class=\"akey-label\">Correct answer</span><div class=\"akey-choice\">Ａ：たぶん 今日 の 午後 届 くと 思 います。</div></div></div><div class=\"akey-item\"><div class=\"akey-head\"><span class=\"akey-num\">Q18</span></div><div class=\"akey-prompt\"><div class=\"fr-view\"><p>Please choose the correct answer to this question: <ruby>明日 <rt>あした</rt> </ruby>の <ruby>試合 <rt>しあい</rt> </ruby>、 <ruby>日本 <rt>にほん</rt> </ruby>は <ruby>勝 <rt>か</rt> </ruby>つと <ruby>思 <rt>おも</rt> </ruby>いますか。</p></div></div><div class=\"akey-answer\"><span class=\"akey-label\">Correct answer</span><div class=\"akey-choice\">Ａ：もちろん 勝 ちますよ。</div></div></div><div class=\"akey-item\"><div class=\"akey-head\"><span class=\"akey-num\">Q19</span></div><div class=\"akey-prompt\"><div class=\"fr-view\"><p>Please choose the correct answer to this question: <ruby> 頭 <rp>(</rp> <rt>あたま</rt> <rp>)</rp> </ruby>が <ruby> 痛 <rp>(</rp> <rt>いた</rt> <rp>)</rp> </ruby>いですから、 <ruby> 今日 <rp>(</rp> <rt>きょう</rt> <rp>)</rp> </ruby>は <ruby> 帰 <rp>(</rp> <rt>かえ</rt> <rp>)</rp> </ruby>ります。</p></div></div><div class=\"akey-answer\"><span class=\"akey-label\">Correct answer</span><div class=\"akey-choice\">Ａ：そうですか。 お 大事 に。</div></div></div><div class=\"akey-item\"><div class=\"akey-head\"><span class=\"akey-num\">Q20</span></div><div class=\"akey-prompt\"><div class=\"fr-view\"><p>Please choose the correct answer to this question: すみません。　<ruby>郵便<rt>ゆうびん</rt></ruby><ruby>局<rt>きょく</rt></ruby>へ　<ruby>行<rt>い</rt></ruby>きたいんですが…。</p></div></div><div class=\"akey-answer\"><span class=\"akey-label\">Correct answer</span><div class=\"akey-choice\">Ａ：この 道 を まっすぐ 行 くと、 ありますよ。</div></div></div><div class=\"akey-item\"><div class=\"akey-head\"><span class=\"akey-num\">Q21</span></div><div class=\"akey-prompt\"><div class=\"fr-view\"><p>Please choose the correct question from the below to receive this answer： <ruby>東京<rt>とうきょう</rt></ruby>が　いちばん　<ruby>人<rt>ひと</rt></ruby>が　<ruby>多<rt>おお</rt></ruby>いです。</p></div></div><div class=\"akey-answer\"><span class=\"akey-label\">Correct answer</span><div class=\"akey-choice\">Ｑ： 日本 で どこが いちばん 人 が 多 いですか。</div></div></div><div class=\"akey-item\"><div class=\"akey-head\"><span class=\"akey-num\">Q22</span></div><div class=\"akey-prompt\">Please choose the correct question from the below to receive this answer： ええ、　いいですよ。</div><div class=\"akey-answer\"><span class=\"akey-label\">Correct answer</span><div class=\"akey-choice\">Ｑ：すみません。 カーテンを 閉 めても いいですか。</div></div></div><div class=\"akey-item\"><div class=\"akey-head\"><span class=\"akey-num\">Q23</span></div><div class=\"akey-prompt\"><div class=\"fr-view\"><p>Please choose the correct question from the below to receive this answer： Ａ：ええ、　もう　<ruby>夏<rt>なつ</rt></ruby>ですね。</p></div></div><div class=\"akey-answer\"><span class=\"akey-label\">Correct answer</span><div class=\"akey-choice\">Ｑ： 暑 く なりましたね。</div></div></div><div class=\"akey-item\"><div class=\"akey-head\"><span class=\"akey-num\">Q24</span></div><div class=\"akey-prompt\"><div class=\"fr-view\"><p>Please choose the correct question from the below to receive this answer： <ruby>教<rt>おし</rt></ruby>え<ruby>方<rt>かた</rt></ruby>が　<ruby>上手<rt>じょうず</rt></ruby>だと　<ruby>思<rt>おも</rt></ruby>います。</p></div></div><div class=\"akey-answer\"><span class=\"akey-label\">Correct answer</span><div class=\"akey-choice\">Ｑ： 日本語 の 先生 に ついて、 どう 思 いますか。</div></div></div><div class=\"akey-item\"><div class=\"akey-head\"><span class=\"akey-num\">Q25</span></div><div class=\"akey-prompt\"><div class=\"fr-view\"><p>Please choose the correct question from the below to receive this answer： <ruby>明日<rt>あした</rt></ruby>は　<ruby>休<rt>やす</rt></ruby>むと　<ruby>言<rt>い</rt></ruby>いました。</p></div></div><div class=\"akey-answer\"><span class=\"akey-label\">Correct answer</span><div class=\"akey-choice\">Ｑ： 山田 さんは 何 と 言 いましたか。</div></div></div><div class=\"akey-item\"><div class=\"akey-head\"><span class=\"akey-num\">Q26</span></div><div class=\"akey-prompt\"><div class=\"fr-view\">\n<p>Please look at the picture and choose the sentence that describes it. </p>\n<p><img class=\"fr-fic fr-dib\" src=\"../images/tests/week_08/week4-8test_q26.png\" style=\"width: 300px;\"/></p>\n</div></div><div class=\"akey-answer\"><span class=\"akey-label\">Correct answer</span><div class=\"akey-choice\">宿題 を した あとで、 シャワーを 浴 びました。</div></div></div><div class=\"akey-item\"><div class=\"akey-head\"><span class=\"akey-num\">Q27</span></div><div class=\"akey-prompt\"><div class=\"fr-view\">\n<p>Please look at the picture and choose the sentence that describes it. </p>\n<p><img class=\"fr-fic fr-dib\" src=\"../images/tests/week_08/week4-8test_q27.png\" style=\"width: 100px;\"/></p>\n</div></div><div class=\"akey-answer\"><span class=\"akey-label\">Correct answer</span><div class=\"akey-choice\">あの 帽子 を かぶって いる 人 は リンさんです。</div></div></div><div class=\"akey-item\"><div class=\"akey-head\"><span class=\"akey-num\">Q28</span></div><div class=\"akey-prompt\"><div class=\"fr-view\">\n<p>Please look at the picture and choose the sentence that describe it.</p>\n<p><img class=\"fr-fic fr-dib\" src=\"../images/tests/week_08/week4-8test_q28.png\" style=\"width: 300px;\"/></p>\n</div></div><div class=\"akey-answer\"><span class=\"akey-label\">Correct answer</span><div class=\"akey-choice\">信号 を 右 へ 曲 がって、 少 し 歩 くと、 右 に 銀行 が あります。</div></div></div><div class=\"akey-item\"><div class=\"akey-head\"><span class=\"akey-num\">Q29</span></div><div class=\"akey-prompt\"><div class=\"fr-view\">\n<p>Please look at the picture and choose the right answer.</p>\n<p><img class=\"fr-fic fr-dib\" src=\"../images/tests/week_08/week4-8test_q29.png\" style=\"width: 300px;\"/></p>\n<p><ruby>成田空港<rt>なりたくうこう</rt></ruby>から　<ruby>東京<rt>とうきょう</rt></ruby><ruby>駅<rt>えき</rt></ruby>まで　バスで　どのくらい　かかりますか。</p>\n</div></div><div class=\"akey-answer\"><span class=\"akey-label\">Correct answer</span><div class=\"akey-choice\">1 時間 半 かかります。</div></div></div><div class=\"akey-item\"><div class=\"akey-head\"><span class=\"akey-num\">Q30</span></div><div class=\"akey-prompt\"><div class=\"fr-view\">\n<p>Please look at the picture and choose the right answer.</p>\n<p><img class=\"fr-fic fr-dib\" src=\"../images/tests/week_08/week4-8test_q30.png\" style=\"width: 100px;\"/></p>\n<p><ruby>田中<rt>たなか</rt></ruby>さんは　<ruby>何<rt>なに</rt></ruby>を　して　いますか。</p>\n</div></div><div class=\"akey-answer\"><span class=\"akey-label\">Correct answer</span><div class=\"akey-choice\">手紙 を かいて います。</div></div></div></div>",
